<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Happy Birthday Prince 💙</title>

<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
body{
  min-height:100vh;
  font-family:Arial,sans-serif;
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,#06152e,#0b3d91,#071b3a);
  color:white;
  display:flex;
  justify-content:center;
  align-items:center;
  text-align:center;
  overflow:hidden;
}
.container{padding:25px;max-width:700px}
h1{
  font-size:clamp(45px,10vw,85px);
  color:#fff;
  text-shadow:0 0 15px #4db8ff,0 0 35px #168cff;
  animation:glow 2s infinite alternate;
}
h2{font-size:30px;margin:15px 0;color:#8ed8ff}
p{font-size:19px;line-height:1.7;margin:15px 0}
.cake{font-size:90px;animation:bounce 1.5s infinite}
button{
  margin-top:20px;
  padding:15px 30px;
  border:0;
  border-radius:30px;
  background:#1597ff;
  color:white;
  font-size:18px;
  font-weight:bold;
  cursor:pointer;
  box-shadow:0 0 20px #1597ff;
}
button:hover{transform:scale(1.08)}
#surprise{
  display:none;
  margin-top:25px;
  padding:20px;
  border-radius:20px;
  background:rgba(255,255,255,.12);
  backdrop-filter:blur(8px);
}
.heart{
  position:absolute;
  font-size:25px;
  animation:fall linear infinite;
}
@keyframes glow{
  from{text-shadow:0 0 10px #4db8ff}
  to{text-shadow:0 0 30px #00c8ff,0 0 60px #168cff}
}
@keyframes bounce{
  50%{transform:translateY(-15px)}
}
@keyframes fall{
  from{transform:translateY(-100px) rotate(0)}
  to{transform:translateY(110vh) rotate(360deg)}
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="container">
  <div class="cake">🎂</div>

  <h1>Happy Birthday!</h1>
  <h2>Prince 💙</h2>

  <p>
    To an amazing brother — you are more than just family.
    You are someone who makes life brighter, crazier and more memorable. 🫂
  </p>

  <p>
    May your birthday bring you happiness, success, laughter
    and countless unforgettable moments. ✨
  </p>

  <button onclick="showSurprise()">🎁 Open Your Surprise</button>

  <div id="surprise">
    <h2>💙 A Special Message 💙</h2>
    <p>
      No matter how much we argue, tease each other or drive each other crazy 😂,
      you'll always be my brother and I'll always be cheering for you.
    </p>
    <p><b>Happy Birthday, Prince! 🥳🎂💙</b></p>
    <p>Keep smiling. Keep shining. Keep being YOU! ⭐</p>
  </div>
</div>

<script>
function showSurprise(){
  document.getElementById("surprise").style.display="block";
  for(let i=0;i<35;i++){
    const h=document.createElement("div");
    h.className="heart";
    h.innerHTML=["💙","✨","🎉","🎈"][Math.floor(Math.random()*4)];
    h.style.left=Math.random()*100+"vw";
    h.style.animationDuration=(3+Math.random()*5)+"s";
    h.style.animationDelay=Math.random()*2+"s";
    document.body.appendChild(h);
  }
}
</script>

</body>
</html>
